###     stringrequired
###
###     Asset pair to get data for
###     Example: XBTUSD
###     since
###     integer
###
###     Returns spread data since given timestamp. Optional, intended for incremental updates within available dataset (does not contain all historical spreads).
###     Example: 1678219570
