###     object
###     last
###     integer
###
###     ID to be used as since when polling for new spread data
###     property name*
###     SpreadData
###
###     Array of spread entries [int <time>, string <bid>, string <ask>]
###     Array [
###     type
###     items object
###     oneOf
###         string
###         integer
###
###     string
###     ]
###     error
###     string[]
###
### Response example:
### {
###   "error": [],
###   "result": {
###     "XXBTZUSD": [
###       [
###         1688671834,
###         "30292.10000",
###         "30297.50000"
